## NuGet
*.nupkg
packages/

# NOTE: packages.lock.json MUST be committed.
# Dalamud.NET.Sdk sets RestorePackagesWithLockFile=true, and CI restore depends on it.
!packages.lock.json

# TRIPWIRE — never create Warcry/Warcry.json.
# DalamudPackager resolves the manifest json -> yaml -> csproj and FIRST HIT WINS,
# with no merge and no warning. A Warcry.json here silently kills every
# <Author>/<Name>/<Punchline>/<Description>/<RepoUrl>/<Tags> property in the csproj.
# This project is csproj-only. See docs/PLAN.md 3.6.
Warcry/Warcry.json
Warcry/Warcry.yaml
